  "details": "When the vive trackpad input gets close to the x or y axis, it snaps to zero on that respective axis. This is very noticeable when using the trackpad to move the player slowly in a specific direction, but the trackpad locks to an axis and forces the player to move in only one cardinal direction. This can also be observed with the action menu by slowly moving across the trackpad, and whenever it gets close to an axis, the action menu circle can be seen locked to that axis.",
